      <activity id="7cf15070-ebaf-5e5c-a161-6ebac0d970ce" activityNameId="e9a274ac-ed7b-5284-aad8-59c695236291" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, wood-metal window, natural/varnished, m2 visible, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, wood-metal window, natural/varnished, m2 visible, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The average visible area is 0.29m2. The bill of materials is based on data from 4 window producers.;
UUID: dd634f58-226f-3667-a8b6-0805091385c6
Included are the materials used for the surface treatment (natural/varnished) for a wood-metal window. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dd634f58-226f-3667-a8b6-0805091385c6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
